==Battleground==
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 50 seconds<sup>1,500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 20~40 seconds<sup>600f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Sagat (Enemy)|Sagat]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[E. Honda (Enemy)|E. Honda]] spawns.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Croco]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The main threat of this stage is Sagat. His waves, strengthen, and Omnistrike create a powerful combo. You can either try to tank it with powerful units such as [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera Cat]] or stack units with high range to create a huge DPS stack such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] or [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cat]]. The Gabriels and Heavenly Hippoes are only at 100% magnification, so they are not threatening.

